━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
  Patch 1: patch1   ┃  Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only the
source lines quoted in the patches.

═════════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES                  *
═════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that patch.
A sign-less line with one number is an
edit both patches make: a new number
means both add it, an old number means
both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f          ┃ old new│f
        │@@ alpha on┃        │@@ bravo tw
        │e          ┃        │o
   1   1│alpha one  ┃        │
   2   2│target line┃        │
   3   3│bravo two  ┃   3   3│bravo two
   4   4│drop me    ┃-  4    │drop me
   5   5│charlie    ┃        │
   6   6│delta      ┃        │
   7   7│echo       ┃        │
   8   8│foxtrot    ┃        │
   9   9│golf       ┃        │
  10  10│alpha one  ┃   5   4│alpha one
  11  11│target line┃-  6    │target line
- 12    │hotel      ┃   7   5│bravo two
+     12│P1_hotel   ┃        │

═════════════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES                *
═════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only one
result: - patch1, + patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│f          ┃     new│f
        │@@ bravo tw┃        │@@ bravo tw
        │o          ┃        │o
       3│bravo two  ┃       3│bravo two
-      4│drop me    ┃        │
-      5│charlie    ┃        │
-      6│delta      ┃        │
-      7│echo       ┃        │
-      8│foxtrot    ┃        │
